---

### Final Thought

Start small: build a minimal viable product (MVP) with just a few products and basic cart functionality. Once the MVP works, iterate—add filters, search, reviews, admin panel, analytics, and so on. Keep the code modular, test-driven, and well‑documented. Happy coding!
